  "bodyHash": "b9ca786e82eb9d3f",
  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#843fa1\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:36px\">&nbsp;集成简单剑</span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\">目前支持 (Neo)Forge 1.20.1</span></strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>&nbsp;作者</strong> <span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\"><strong>Craisinlord</strong></span> </span></span><strong>和 <span style=\"color:#236fa1\">Qwerty97475</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#e03e2d\"><strong>[图片]</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#843fa1\"><strong>什么是集成简单剑？<br></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">集成简单剑是一款《简单剑》(Simply Swords) <strong>附加模组</strong>，旨在当安装了添加其他武器材质的模组时，<strong>填补缺失的剑</strong>。<br>此外，还计划为某些特定的模组/生物群系/概念添加主题化的<strong>独特武器</strong>。<br><br><strong>它主要面向</strong>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/integrated-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated MC</a>&nbsp;<strong>整合包开发，</strong>其中的模组更有可能获得兼容性优先支持，<strong>但也非常欢迎你在自己的整合包中使用！<br><br>也非常欢迎提供关于模组兼容性的</strong>建议！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#236fa1\"><strong>纹理由 Qwerty97475 制作</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1104/246/image_2025-02-21_184716117.png\" width=\"506\" height=\"690\"></strong></p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>必要模组：</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-swords\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Swords</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Architectury API</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cloth Config API<br></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>可选支持的模组：</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-combat-by-daedelus\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better&nbsp;Combat</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire: Dragons</a><br></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caverns-and-chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns &amp; Chasms</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/galosphere\" rel=\"nofollow\">Galosphere</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eidolon-repraised\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eidolon: Repraised</a></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oreganized\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oreganized</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/born-in-chaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">Born in Chaos</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>计划支持的模组：</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/aether\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Aether</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">其他类似的简单剑附加模组：</span><br></strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/knaves-needs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Knave's Needs<br></a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-compatible\" rel=\"nofollow\">Simply Swords Modded Compatibility<br></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#843fa1\"><strong>免责声明</strong></span></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>关于 Integrated MC</strong></span></h3>\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">集成简单剑</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;的主要功能是</strong></span></span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>&nbsp;为<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/integrated-minecraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Minecraft</a>整合包中的模组</strong>添加<strong>自定义简单剑</strong><strong>兼容支持</strong>。这意味着 Integrated Minecraft 整合包内的模组将<strong>优先获得整合支持</strong>，而非该整合包内的模组则优先级较低。</span></p>\n<p>此外，<strong>集成简单剑</strong>可能会进行一些<strong>与原版模组不同的更改</strong>。例如，纹理可能会基于资源包设计，而非采用模组的原始纹理。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>整合标准</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">只有<strong>完全满足以下所有条件</strong>的工具套装才会被考虑进行整合：<br></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">包含<strong>剑</strong>、<strong>斧</strong>、<strong>镐</strong>、<strong>锹</strong>、<strong>锄</strong>等工具——如果模组作者认为某件工具不需要配备这些基础武器类型，那么为其添加简单剑可能并不合适。</span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">与<strong>集成简单剑</strong>保持<strong>相同的 Minecraft 版本</strong>——我们不会为了适配更多模组而将本模组移植到其他版本。<br></span></span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">拥有高质量的纹理</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">——我不希望使用糟糕的配色方案来重绘纹理，但如果该模组有<strong>优质的资源包</strong>，可能会被优先考虑。</span></span></li>\n<li><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">属于热门</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">模组——否则投入时间增加兼容性的性价比不高，不如优先支持更受欢迎的模组。</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#843fa1\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">支持 Craisin！</span></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>查看我的其他项目！</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/integrated-minecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Minecraft</a>，集成结构系列官方整合包</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-stronghold\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Stronghold</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/integrated-villages\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Villages</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/idas\" rel=\"nofollow\">Integrated Dungeons and Structures (IDAS)<br></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Bisect 服务器托管</strong></span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fcraisincraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/452/988/bh_id_promo.png\" width=\"778\" height=\"115\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">我花费了超过 3 年时间开发 Minecraft 模组，并为此专门学习了 Java。如果你非常喜爱我的作品，可以通过 Patreon 直接支持我，或者通过<strong>Bisect Hosting</strong>购买服务器来支持。点击上方图片即可获取服务器，使用我的优惠码<strong>CraisinCraft</strong>可在<strong>首月享受 25% 折扣</strong>，并与好友畅玩！配置非常简单，<strong>基本上只需一键操作</strong>。<br><br></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Patreon</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>点击下方图片</strong>访问我的<strong>Patreon</strong>页面以直接支持我。你将获得专属的<strong>Discord 身份组</strong>、聊天权限，并能直接影响我的模组开发方向。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/craisinlord\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/453/148/digital-patreon-wordmark_fierycoral.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"432\" height=\"88\"></a></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>Discord</strong></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>点击下方图片或链接加入 Discord</strong>，如果遇到<strong>任何问题</strong>或有<strong>建议</strong>，我会尽力回复每一位用户，也非常期待你的建议！<strong>感谢游玩并支持我的模组！</strong>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.com/invite/72a7jmc5mb\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/IDAS/BH_ID_DISCORD.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1125\" height=\"111\"></a></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;<a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.com/invite/72a7jmc5mb\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/invite/72a7jmc5mb<br><br></a></span></p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></h3>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#800080\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">备注与鸣谢</span><br></span></strong></span></p>\n<hr>\n<h3>&nbsp;</h3>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><br>特别鸣谢：</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Craisin 的赞助者们</strong>！！！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Qwerty97475</strong> 为制作纹理！！！</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>Fel</strong> 和 <strong>绝对不是 Darkosto 粉丝</strong> 提供的灵感<br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br></span>\n<h3><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>纹理说明：</strong></span><br></span></h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">冰火模组兼容纹理基于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/ice-fire-dragonsteel-weaponry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰火龙钢武器</a>&nbsp;和&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/frostbiteandbrimstone\" rel=\"nofollow\">霜冻与硫磺</a>&nbsp;的纹理设计</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">银质兼容纹理基于&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caverns-and-chasms\" rel=\"nofollow\">洞穴与裂谷</a>&nbsp;的纹理<br><br>其余所有纹理均基于其所支持模组的原始素材。</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
